---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy — HarmonyBreath';
const description = 'HarmonyBreath privacy policy. Learn how we handle your data, our use of Google AdSense, and your choices regarding cookies and personalized advertising.';
const canonicalUrl = 'https://harmonybreath.com/privacy';
---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonicalUrl={canonicalUrl}
>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-1 hero-gradient-mesh relative">
    <section class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
      <div class="text-center space-y-4 mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-amber-400/30 bg-amber-400/10 text-amber-400 text-xs font-mono">
          Privacy First
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-sm font-sans font-light">Last updated: July 27, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light [&_h2]:text-white [&_h2]:text-xl [&_h2]:sm:text-2xl [&_h2]:font-bold [&_h2]:mt-10 [&_h2]:mb-4 [&_h3]:text-white [&_h3]:text-lg [&_h3]:font-semibold [&_h3]:mt-8 [&_h3]:mb-3 [&_strong]:text-white [&_strong]:font-medium [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:list-inside [&_ul]:space-y-2 [&_ul]:text-neutral-400">
        <h2>Our Commitment to Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          HarmonyBreath is built on a fundamental belief: your breathing practice is personal, and your data should remain yours. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information when you use our website and breathing tools, including our use of Google AdSense for advertising.
        </p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          HarmonyBreath does <strong>not</strong> collect, store, or process any personal data on our servers. We do not have accounts, user registration, or any server-side data storage. Specifically:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>We do not collect your name, email address, IP address, or any personally identifiable information.</li>
          <li>We do not store your session data, breathing history, or preferences on any server.</li>
          <li>We do not use analytics services, tracking scripts, or fingerprinting technologies.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Local Storage</h2>
        <p>
          HarmonyBreath uses your browser's <strong>localStorage</strong> to save preferences such as volume settings and session history. This data never leaves your device. You can clear this data at any time through your browser settings. No one — including us — can access this information.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and Advertising</h2>
        <p>
          We use <strong>Google AdSense</strong>, a third-party advertising service provided by Google LLC ("Google"). AdSense may use cookies and similar technologies to serve personalized advertisements based on your previous visits to our website and other sites across the internet.
        </p>
        <p>Specifically, Google and its partners may use cookies for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>To serve interest-based (personalized) advertisements relevant to your interests.</li>
          <li>To limit the number of times you see a particular ad (frequency capping).</li>
          <li>To measure the effectiveness of advertising campaigns.</li>
          <li>To report aggregated usage statistics to advertisers.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          These cookies are set and controlled by Google, not by HarmonyBreath. We do not have access to any data collected by these cookies.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Your Choices:</strong> You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
          <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 underline underline-offset-2">Google Ads Settings</a>.
          You can also opt out of third-party cookies used for interest-based advertising through the
          <a href="https://optout.networkadvertising.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 underline underline-offset-2">Network Advertising Initiative opt-out page</a>.
          If you choose to reject personalized advertising, you will still see ads, but they will be non-personalized (contextual).
        </p>
        <p>
          For more information about how Google uses data, please review
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 underline underline-offset-2">How Google uses data when you use our partners' sites or apps</a>
          and Google's
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 underline underline-offset-2">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          Our website integrates the following third-party services:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> — serves advertisements and uses cookies as described above.</li>
          <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> — web fonts served to enhance visual appearance. Google Fonts may log requests including IP addresses and user agent strings for aggregated usage reporting and security purposes.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not integrate any other third-party analytics, social media tracking pixels, comment systems, or external services.
        </p>

        <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>
          Since we do not collect personal data, we do not sell, rent, trade, or transfer any personal information to third parties. We do not respond to requests for user data because we have none to provide. However, Google may collect and process data through AdSense cookies as described in the Cookies and Advertising section above.
        </p>

        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Our services are suitable for all ages. We do not knowingly collect any information from children under 13. Google AdSense may serve non-personalized ads to children in compliance with the Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA). We have configured our AdSense account to comply with COPPA requirements where applicable.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted on this page with a new effective date. Material changes will be communicated via the website. Continued use of HarmonyBreath after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, you can <a href="/contact" class="text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 underline underline-offset-2">contact us here</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
